## Verification

Perform verification on the settled file tree **ONLY AFTER** you have completed all planned code modifications and all spawned `{{MODULE}}-*-package-agent` instances have returned.

Execute the following steps before submitting your final report:

```bash
# Verify scope strictly for modified files within this module
for p in $(git status --porcelain {{MODULE}} | cut -c4-); do
  bash {{OUT_DIR}}/check-write-scope.sh "$p" {{ALLOWED_ARGS}}
done

# Build and install the specified module to the local Maven repository
mvn -q install -pl {{MODULE}} -DfailIfNoTests=false
```

